      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "**SRE Golden Signals** \u2014 the four numbers that answer \"is this system okay\" faster than anything else. \ud83d\udfe9 Green = healthy \u00b7 \ud83d\udfe8 Yellow = degrading, look soon \u00b7 \ud83d\udfe5 Red = act now. Latency uses kube-apiserver's own request histogram (the one real p95 histogram live in this cluster today \u2014 no app here yet exposes its own `_duration_seconds_bucket`, so once one does, repoint this panel at it). Errors and Traffic use ingress-nginx, live.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
